                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "I got an AB in an easy A class. The ONLY reason for this is I skipped class a lot. Don't be me. The class is very interesting and enjoyable, even for non education majors. There is A LOT of reading she assigns, but I did none of it and I was fine. She summarizes the important points in class. Participate &amp; be invested in class and you'll get an A!",
